{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a Gemwielder, capable of controlling ancient artifacts called Gembearers. Powerful by themselves, only by socketing them with magical gems will you acquire unique abilities that allow you to prevail in a duel with another Gemwielder.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your favorite character to <strong>compete online</strong> against other Gemwielders around the world or face your teacher Sokras and <strong>climb the Student Ranks.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game you adapt to a novel configuration of gems and cards and craft a new deck with a unique color combination. <strong>No two games are the same</strong> and whoever seizes the opportunities presented to them best, will be rewarded.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemwielders is <strong>designed around interaction</strong> from the ground up. The <strong>innovative combat system</strong> allows attack and defense cards to clash each turn and interact meaningfully. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards are illustrated traditionally in <strong>ink and watercolor,</strong> giving the game a unique feel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Expansions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemwielders will receive <strong>free expansions.</strong> Buy the game once and <strong>play with all the characters and gems as they come out</strong> with no additional purchase needed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Replayabilty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Watercolor Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair Business Model</p></li><li><p 